    "reason": "POI, road-network and area-context features require an external geospatial reference layer. The public US 311 datasets contain none, and this repository ships no POI/road/boundary reference data \u2014 data/external does not exist. The columns are emitted with the correct name and dtype and left NULL so the schema is stable for the day an Indian PostGIS provider is connected. They are NOT imputed."
